OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FEarly fog and mist clear
OL,6,Fslowly, lingering in prone spots,
OL,7,Fleaving a dry day with light winds and
OL,8,Fsunny spells. Mild for the time of
OL,9,Fyear where fog clears.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FClear skies and light winds
OL,12,Fovernight, with widespread mist and
OL,13,Ffog forming by morning, particularly
OL,14,Facross the east of the region.
OL,15,FChillier than Thursday night.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSaturday:FFog and mist generally lift
OL,18,Fbut stubborn to clear in prone areas,
OL,19,Fwith another dry and bright day to
OL,20,Ffollow. Winds remaining light.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
