OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FAnother
OL,6,Ffoggy start on Sunday, but a cloudier
OL,7,Fday follows with patchy light rain.
OL,8,FDry with sunny spells through Monday
OL,9,Fand Tuesday. Light winds throughout.
